            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "agreed. if nobody objects i will \n\n- mark the interface deprecated in trunk and 2.0-branch, \n- adjust the subject accordingly and \n- resolve this issue fixed.",
          "updateAuthor": {
